# No microSD card answers: the report is not saved, the program says why and
# carries on.
@debug
say "^Press a key" 100
key x
key o
say "^WARN  Gate overridden" 100
card out
key s
say "^WARN  The report could not be saved" 1500
say "^  no card" 100
say "^Check a microSD card is in the device" 100
sdnofile MDTEST-REPORT-00.TXT
